  "planner_forecast_fallbacks": {},
  "disclosures": [
    "The deferral buffer is a runtime wrapper on the cluster-manager instance; upstream source is unmodified. Every controller gets the identical timing policy.",
    "Widening sla_multiplier is a disclosed benchmark modification applied identically to every controller. Upstream's own value is 1.5 and is included as the reference.",
    "The installed carbon series is the realized estimate, so lowest_carbon reads realized intensity and is an oracle; our planner reads the NESO forecast.",
    "Savings are reported against total carbon and against the contestable carbon (total minus the measured idle floor). Only the second is comparable across benchmarks with different idle shares.",
    "The reserve fraction is a single disclosed setting, not tuned on this window; the arrival rate it budgets against is measured from the workload."
  ]
}
